<description>&lt;p&gt;Israel continues airstrikes on southern Lebanese towns such as Aita al-Jabal, Zawtar al-Sharqiyah and the Marjayoun Plain, while Hezbollah artillery fires back at Israeli positions. Hezbollah has begun distributing aid, announcing its first payment to war victims and displaced families and pledging further assistance to those uprooted by the conflict. The United Nations reports 300,000 people displaced in Lebanon due to the fighting. Damage assessments note that Israeli shelling has affected roughly a quarter of Lebanon's agricultural land, worsening the humanitarian situation.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/10/1168713&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimAFBVV95cUxOVmFMbGpGWDl0MzRKbC1CX1FRMmFSS29HcnRKWUhJNThhQmV3SFhTdlZqbGFxXzJKTklRWGJlUTd2Q01ScTZXelJVd1d4aXhNT2pzSzcwRGhjeWFRNUl3WFdkbkVUejFuSmF5cURRemRINC1tMEdMM1ZYLUVjaGhwOTM5bUk5RkZ0eTg1VnFKQW9QOG5Eb0pRWQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily Beirut&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiT0FVX3lxTE94TG00aFRqRXJrSW1uam1LZmZiQWgtWmU2LUVMTmdLTlIxbGRuaFJCUktTYzVnM2pOeWRxaWstSmVjOHVOZl9qcGlXdkN4aVU?oc=5&quot;&gt;MTV Lebanon&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiT0FVX3lxTE0xMUh6SWNERFhYbWowQzF6Zzd3M3UyaU5scFpHQTQ4cGhUWDUzYV93TklkUno3UTFsSGdQbnJiZzJYcW1QdmtlWUNsb3J3eDg?oc=5&quot;&gt;MTV Lebanon&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirgFBVV95cUxNb3ktVzdRWlpxQWVpeTB2ZF9LY0VLcHUxRHQwNnV0RU9yUkdJUG50NjFxVDVMbE5LckVBQU9yOWZVVFpVTDhOTC1kamp2SzFrRF9QbnJ3anpDQjBqT3k5Z1pmWjdpUjJHVHNQc2M5TFdRdEVaUXhhZjI0emMwSUdNNnhCUld4TXYtblc2c3dPN1h6YjFnZTBCOGlSNVZrNG1iTi15RVA0bVpzc0xHZkE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Palestine Chronicle&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.